@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 15
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 15
skinparam NoteFontSize 15
skinparam LegendFontSize 14
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 28
title Component view · Processing separates control from execution\nAs built at 76282d3
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/handlers.py#L25
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L232
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L136
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/worker/sqs.py#L109
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/worker/tasks.py#L16
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/worker/supervisor.py#L111
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/launcher_aws.py#L54
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/launcher_aws.py#L96
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/launcher_trigger.py#L32
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam LegendFontSize 16
top to bottom direction
component "lambda_handler / v1_api / auth\nprocessing.handlers" as Entry $PROC
component "messaging / short_lane" as Msg <<Transactional Outbox>> $PROC
component "lifecycle\nrecovery / recovery_v1" as Life $PROC
component "models / messaging_models\nlauncher_models / database" as SQL $PROC
component "short_encoder / worker.sqs\nworker.tasks" as W $PROC
component "worker.supervisor.Supervisor" as Sup <<Adapter>> $PROC
component "media_engine.probe / operations\nhls / validation" as Engine $PROC
component "worker.source.SourceStore\nworker.storage.OutputStore" as Store <<Adapter>> $PROC
component "launcher / launcher_aws\nEcsPort / QueueDepth" as Launch <<Adapter>> $PROC
component "delivery.sql / delivery.sqs.SQS\ncontracts.v1" as D $INFRA
interface "handle_command / retry_job\nclaim / finish" as IM
interface "download / put" as IS
Msg -- IM
Entry ..> IM
W ..> IM
Msg ..> Life : claim / live
Life ..> SQL
Msg ..> SQL
Entry ..> Life : run_once
Entry ..> Launch : run -> tick
Launch ..> SQL : reservations
Msg ..> D : accept / stage / publish_due
W ..> Engine : build commands / parse
W ..> Sup : guard / run
Sup ..> Life : heartbeat
W ..> IS
Store -- IS
legend bottom
Amber = Processing (including media_engine); slate = shared library. Circle = provided exports; dashed = dependency.
Direct ORM persists state. Stores adapt Minio; Supervisor adapts subprocess; engine functions are pure builders.
handlers wraps SQS with processing.launcher_trigger.WakeOnWork; EcsPort/QueueDepth adapt boto3 ECS/SQS.
endlegend

@enduml
